 35   c  TITL$Nuclear Structure and Decay Data for A=35 Isobars                 
 35   c  AUTH$LIJIE SUN AND JUN CHEN                                            
 35   c  INST$Facility for Rare Isotope Beams, 35 #c Michigan State University, 
